     "source": "‘What did you take her?’"
    },
    {
     "id": "p006.s09",
     "source": "‘I took her nothing, she gave me something.’"
    },
    {
     "id": "p006.s10",
     "source": "‘What did Gretel give you?’"
    },
    {
     "id": "p006.s11",
     "source": "‘Gave me a bit of bacon.’"
    },
    {
     "id": "p006.s12",
     "source": "‘Where is the bacon, Hans?’"
    },
    {
     "id": "p006.s13",
     "source": "‘I tied it to a rope, brought it home, dogs took it.’"
    },
    {
     "id": "p006.s14",
     "source": "‘That was ill done, Hans, you should have carried the bacon on your head.’"
    },
    {
     "id": "p006.s15",
     "source": "‘Never mind, will do better next time.’"
    }
